(7676532, 1255084, 30049, '<td valign="top">Umm.  No.  Sorry.</td>', 'Umm.  No.  Sorry.', '2020-10-11 22:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676533, 1255078, 30049, '<td valign="top">Pleasant view.  Thanks for showing us some land here.  Starting to wonder where it went.  ;-}</td>', 'Pleasant view.  Thanks for showing us some land here.  Starting to wonder where it went.  ;-}', '2020-10-11 22:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676534, 1255069, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I wonder if this would have a bit more drama at a different time of day when the lighting isn''t quite as harsh?</td>', 'Nice.  I wonder if this would have a bit more drama at a different time of day when the lighting isn''t quite as harsh?', '2020-10-11 22:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676536, 1255049, 30049, '<td valign="top">Lovely landscape.  The foreground shadows help with a sense of mystery to what''s on the edge and acts a bit as a vignette helper.  :-)</td>', 'Lovely landscape.  The foreground shadows help with a sense of mystery to what''s on the edge and acts a bit as a vignette helper.  :-)', '2020-10-11 22:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676537, 1255061, 30049, '<td valign="top">Where''s the pruners when you need one?</td>', 'Where''s the pruners when you need one?', '2020-10-11 22:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676538, 1255070, 30049, '<td valign="top">Such a barren looking place! Given all the moss it must be in a perpetual state of dampness?</td>', 'Such a barren looking place! Given all the moss it must be in a perpetual state of dampness?', '2020-10-11 22:32:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676539, 1254932, 30049, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Hard to get a sense of scale, but still interesting.</td>', 'Very cool.  Hard to get a sense of scale, but still interesting.', '2020-10-11 22:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676540, 1254954, 30049, '<td valign="top">Up close and personal.  Watch out for those leaning trees on the right - they look like they''re ready to fall over anytime now!  :-)</td>', 'Up close and personal.  Watch out for those leaning trees on the right - they look like they''re ready to fall over anytime now!  :-)', '2020-10-11 22:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676541, 1255076, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is fun to look at.  The tractor adds a nice sense of scale and so many interesting lines to follow.</td>', 'This is fun to look at.  The tractor adds a nice sense of scale and so many interesting lines to follow.', '2020-10-11 22:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676542, 1255103, 30049, '<td valign="top">Well ... there IS some land here.</td>', 'Well ... there IS some land here.', '2020-10-11 22:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676543, 1255073, 30049, '<td valign="top">Yep.  It''s a family.  Personally, I was looking for more of a landscape subject for this challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'Yep.  It''s a family.  Personally, I was looking for more of a landscape subject for this challenge.  Good luck.', '2020-10-11 22:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676544, 1254940, 30049, '<td valign="top">Hazy, lazy, day.  :-)  Looks like a lot of industry nestled in between those hills?  Love your title BTW.</td>', 'Hazy, lazy, day.  :-)  Looks like a lot of industry nestled in between those hills?  Love your title BTW.', '2020-10-11 22:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676545, 1255090, 30049, '<td valign="top">Nice subject matter and I like the middle ground yellows providing a leading line.  DOF could be stronger, and there''s a strong hint of cyan.</td>', 'Nice subject matter and I like the middle ground yellows providing a leading line.  DOF could be stronger, and there''s a strong hint of cyan.', '2020-10-11 22:42:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676546, 1255001, 30049, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image.  I''m slightly torn on the landscape aspect of this.  Yes, it''s definitely a landscape, but it''s also very much about the flowers.  Hmm.  Ok, it''s going into my top tier votes.  You convinced me.  :-)</td>', 'This is a lovely image.  I''m slightly torn on the landscape aspect of this.  Yes, it''s definitely a landscape, but it''s also very much about the flowers.  Hmm.  Ok, it''s going into my top tier votes.  You convinced me.  :-)', '2020-10-11 22:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676547, 1255088, 30049, '<td valign="top">Could you please tell those people to do something interesting?  LOL  Lovely lighting and I like the lines presented here.</td>', 'Could you please tell those people to do something interesting?  LOL  Lovely lighting and I like the lines presented here.', '2020-10-11 22:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676548, 1254921, 30049, '<td valign="top">Looks like a very photogenic location.  It''s a little limited in scale for a land''scape'' but pleasant enough.  Honestly, the angle presented here with that twig poking in on the left makes me wonder if there wasn''t a slightly different POV that would have been more inclusive (in other words show the tree that belongs to that branch).</td>', 'Looks like a very photogenic location.  It''s a little limited in scale for a land''scape'' but pleasant enough.  Honestly, the angle presented here with that twig poking in on the left makes me wonder if there wasn''t a slightly different POV that would have been more inclusive (in other words show the tree that belongs to that branch).', '2020-10-11 22:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(7676550, 1255080, 30049, '<td valign="top">Oh, very lovely scene.  Could be a calendar page for a Northeastern location.</td>', 'Oh, very lovely scene.  Could be a calendar page for a Northeastern location.', '2020-10-11 22:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
