(7676896, 1255092, 114285, '<td valign="top">Well Mark I''m gobsmacked as unto why this didn''t ribbon! Clearly there is no sky but water to me. I actually bumped this to a 10, not that it made much difference!<br/> <br/>I would love a tilt shift challenge btw, you achieved a great affect!</td>', 'Well Mark I''m gobsmacked as unto why this didn''t ribbon! Clearly there is no sky but water to me. I actually bumped this to a 10, not that it made much difference! I would love a tilt shift challenge btw, you achieved a great affect!', '2020-10-16 01:08:11.000000', NULL, 0),
