(7676902, 1255092, 67145, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Well Mark I''m gobsmacked as unto why this didn''t ribbon! Clearly there is no sky but water to me. I actually bumped this to a 10, not that it made much difference!<br/> <br/>I would love a tilt shift challenge btw, you achieved a great affect! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>was just scrolling thru the challenge .. and saw this .. and Anita took the words right out of my mouth .. <br/>well not exactly .. but i was going to say .. really surprised that this didnt come in the top ten at least .. but more like the top 5 .. or ribbon .. its brilliant .. and i cant imagine anyone would think that''s the sky .. i wondered before i opened it during voting .. but when it opened it was totally obvious that it was water and not sky .. <br/>anyway .. this is just a speed hump in the bigger scheme of things .. and i''m glad you entered it .. its a real feast for the eyes .. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Well Mark I''m gobsmacked as unto why this didn''t ribbon! Clearly there is no sky but water to me. I actually bumped this to a 10, not that it made much difference! I would love a tilt shift challenge btw, you achieved a great affect!   was just scrolling thru the challenge .. and saw this .. and Anita took the words right out of my mouth .. well not exactly .. but i was going to say .. really surprised that this didnt come in the top ten at least .. but more like the top 5 .. or ribbon .. its brilliant .. and i cant imagine anyone would think that''s the sky .. i wondered before i opened it during voting .. but when it opened it was totally obvious that it was water and not sky .. anyway .. this is just a speed hump in the bigger scheme of things .. and i''m glad you entered it .. its a real feast for the eyes .. :)', '2020-10-16 01:33:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(7676904, 1254798, 67145, '<td valign="top">its really beautiful Anita .. its like a fairyland .. makes me think of angels and other dimensions where we might see those elusive creatures ... <br/>i love the glow btw ... but i''m a big lover of glow .. i think tho that the sharpening might be a bit too powerful for this soft and dreamy scene .. it gives it a slight harshness .. but as you know .. thats just my opinion .. <br/>i''m loving the colours .. the stunning reflections .. and that scene .. and how if you were there you''d feel enclosed in that beautiful environment .. gorgeous .. :)<br/>helloo .. i''m just wondering if that area top left hand side of the image is the sky .. if ppl made that assumption then that could be why this didnt do so well ..</td>', 'its really beautiful Anita .. its like a fairyland .. makes me think of angels and other dimensions where we might see those elusive creatures ... i love the glow btw ... but i''m a big lover of glow .. i think tho that the sharpening might be a bit too powerful for this soft and dreamy scene .. it gives it a slight harshness .. but as you know .. thats just my opinion .. i''m loving the colours .. the stunning reflections .. and that scene .. and how if you were there you''d feel enclosed in that beautiful environment .. gorgeous .. :)helloo .. i''m just wondering if that area top left hand side of the image is the sky .. if ppl made that assumption then that could be why this didnt do so well ..', '2020-10-16 01:40:04.000000', NULL, 0),
